_pdbx_database_remark.id 
_pdbx_database_remark.text 
400 
;COMPOUND 
PDB ENTRIES 1PNX AND 1PNY REPRESENT ONE CRYSTAL STRUCTURE OF THE E. COLI 70S RIBOSOME. 
THIS FILE, 1PNX, CONTAINS ONLY MOLECULES OF THE 30S RIBOSOMAL SUBUNIT. THE 50S SUBUNIT IS IN THE PDB FILE 1PNY. 
;
999 
;SEQUENCE 
The 30S subunit is derived mainly from 1J5E, the T. thermophilus 30S subunit, with modifications to the rRNA to make it match E. coli insertions and deletions. The sequence of this subunit represent that of pdb entry, 1J5E. As a result, no dbref was provided.
;
# 
